 "description": "Use action=requirements with no data for the exact input schema and where to obtain invoices, bank BRC/FIRC and goods shipping records. Authenticated action=validate is free; action=generate requires existing paid claim access and returns a private JSON download. Documents and aggregate receipts are separate arrays. Money is INR decimal strings. No GST login, OTP, source attachments or payment credentials in arguments. Sandbox only; portal acceptance remains a separate check.",
 "inputSchema": {
